# Quantix Version 1 — FROZEN

Version 1 estimating is **COMPLETE and FROZEN**.

## Do not modify (unless production bug)

- Smart Excel Import / Import Engine v1 (`lib/smart-import/**`, `services/smart-import/**`)
- WBS, BOQ, Resource Library, Unit Rates, Estimate Summary
- Tender Package, Validation, Historical Archive
- Master Templates / Template Reuse / Versioning

## Version 1.1+

New work (e.g. Quantity Takeoff) must live in **separate** modules:

- `features/takeoff/**`
- `services/takeoff/**`
- `lib/takeoff/**`
- `types/takeoff.ts`
- `app/(shell)/projects/[projectId]/takeoff/**`

Takeoff ↔ BOQ quantity linking is authorized in **V1.1 Phase 5** via
`services/takeoff/boq-link.ts` and additive `boq_items.quantity_source` /
`takeoff_boq_links`. Do **not** modify Import Engine, Smart Excel Import,
Master Templates, or Historical Archive. Keep BOQ edits additive (badges /
reverse nav only).
